  <item>
    <title>Vol.08 谈什么恋爱，我愿在暧昧上头那一刻死去</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66695463c26e396a3639fc1e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66695463c26e396a3639fc1e</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 12 Jun 2024 07:55:13 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>哈喽！听众朋友们大家好~本期我们邀请了一位姐妹和我们一起聊聊暧昧这个话题，暧昧是一种比朋友的感情深，比恋人关系浅的状态，它的存在恰巧填补了朋友与恋人之间的空白，我们彼此分享了各自的暧昧经历，重新翻出那段记忆，不仅自己很上头，听着也很上头，希望听完我们经历的你，也可以和我们分享分享你的经历哦~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="54">00:54</a> &nbsp;我们眼中的暧昧是？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="108">01:48</a> &nbsp;我们的暧昧经历~~~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1214">20:14</a> &nbsp;我们迅速上头又迅速下头的经历~~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1935">32:15</a> &nbsp;更喜欢暧昧还是谈恋爱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2093">34:53</a> &nbsp;暧昧有结果的多还是没结果的多？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2402">40:02</a> &nbsp;还会期待暧昧吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2636">43:56</a> &nbsp;男女之间有纯友谊吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2769">46:09</a> &nbsp;暧昧和平淡的恋爱，你会怎么选择？ &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lpo4iWCiPiozX9pFx-LgzRW2tyTd.m4a" length="48946083" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:50:26</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft7xuS1P7pv1t6weIpnCzaqCD4Vo.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.07云上精致人 吃着便利店打折便当：抠抠搜搜地花钱如流水</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6655f4a0790e136fcb528fb0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6655f4a0790e136fcb528fb0</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 28 May 2024 15:13:35 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>哈喽！听众朋友们大家好！最近我们发现身边有很多这样的人：他们网络上过的很精致，但是现实里却很抠搜！ 我们聊了聊身边这样的人，也仿佛看到了自己的一些影子。你们也会有这样的行为吗？618快到了，我们该如何在省钱的前提下 花样精致呢？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="50">00:50</a> &nbsp;精致穷女孩的消费习惯</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="387">06:27</a> &nbsp;我们对云上精致人的看法是？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="556">09:16</a> &nbsp;是虚荣心还是热爱生活？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1238">20:38</a> &nbsp;服装外在的打扮是必要的吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1513">25:13</a> &nbsp;快乐有肤浅和深度之分吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1569">26:09</a> &nbsp;消费观念原来如此重要！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1890">31:30</a> &nbsp;我们的省钱小妙招有？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3168">52:48</a> &nbsp;不要为了省小钱花大钱！</span></p><p><span>主播：汤汤和粥粥</span></p><p><span>听众邮箱：TangTang_ZhouZhou@163.com</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lgjgN6P1la3f5yPb0CJUc6T00cJ3.m4a" length="53693014" type="audio/mp4"/>
